WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.135
- MRS. WHITAKER, I HAVE
BEEN BABYSITTING FOR 20 YEARS.

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:03.604
I'VE SEEN IT ALL.

00:00:03.637 --> 00:00:07.341
- THE THING IS,
FOREST IS A UNIQUE CHILD.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.709
- EVERYTHING
IS GONNA BE FINE.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.177
I WANT YOU TO HAVE
A GOOD TIME TONIGHT.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.812
YOU DESERVE IT.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.114
- OKAY, UM...

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:18.118
GOOD LUCK.
- THANK YOU.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:22.823
[sighs]

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:27.828
[eerie music]

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.497
♪

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:36.670
- GOO-GOO GA-GA.
[heavy footsteps]

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:39.039
- [recoils]

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:41.708
HEY THERE, FOREST.

00:00:41.742 --> 00:00:43.610
- GOO-GOO GA-GA.

00:00:43.644 --> 00:00:45.679
I WANT...

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.548
I WANT MILK.

00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:49.516
- YOU WANT ME TO GET YOU
YOUR BOTTLE, BUDDY?

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:53.187
- I WANT MILK!
- OKAY.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.893
- THIS IS A BA-BA.

00:00:59.927 --> 00:01:01.828
I WANT MAMA'S MILK.

00:01:01.862 --> 00:01:04.932
WHY CAN'T I HAVE
MAMA'S MILK?

00:01:04.965 --> 00:01:06.133
IT'S A SIMPLE REQUEST.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.935
- WELL, YEAH, WELL, UH,

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:10.671
Y-YOU CAN'T HAVE MAMA'S MILK
RIGHT NOW, BUDDY.

00:01:10.704 --> 00:01:11.939
UM, HOW ABOUT WE PLAY?

00:01:11.972 --> 00:01:13.941
- OKAY.

00:01:13.974 --> 00:01:15.442
I WANT...

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.711
I WANT--
I WANNA PLAY WITH MY LEGOS.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.079
- OKAY, YEAH.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.883
OKAY, BUDDY, LET'S, UH,
GET YOUR LEGOS THEN.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.318
- I WANNA...

00:01:24.351 --> 00:01:27.087
I WANNA PUT
THE SMALLEST LEGO IN MY MOUTH.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.622
THAT'S WHAT I'M GONNA DO.
- NO, NO, NO.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:30.958
YOU CAN'T--YOU CAN'T DO THAT.
- WHAT?

00:01:30.991 --> 00:01:33.393
FIRST YOU TELL ME
I CAN'T HAVE MAMA'S MILK.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:37.097
NOW I CAN'T HAVE
THE SMALLEST LEGO IN MY MOUTH?

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.266
WHAT A NIGHT.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.268
THIS IS A BAD START.

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:43.670
- WAIT, BUT FOREST,
IT'S DANGEROUS.

00:01:43.704 --> 00:01:45.005
- LET ME GET THIS STRAIGHT.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:48.408
YOU'RE IN CHARGE OF ME?
IN MY HOUSE?

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:49.843
- ALL RIGHT, F-FOREST,
I-IT'S TIME FOR BED.

00:01:49.877 --> 00:01:52.913
- I GUESS THEN
YOU GONNA SING ME A SONG.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.715
- WHAT?

00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:57.584
- MOMMA ALWAYS SINGS ME A SONG
BEFORE I GO TO SLEEP.

00:01:57.618 --> 00:01:59.219
ARE YOU GONNA
DO THAT FOR ME?

00:01:59.253 --> 00:02:01.221
- OKAY, OKAY.
YEAH.

00:02:01.255 --> 00:02:03.957
YES, I WILL.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:08.195
♪ HUSH, LITTLE BABY
DON'T SAY A WORD ♪

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:10.597
- KEEP--KEEP SINGING.

00:02:10.631 --> 00:02:14.168
- ♪ MAMA'S GONNA
BUY YOU A MOCKINGBIRD ♪

00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:16.670
- PUT MY NAME IN IT.

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:18.572
I LIKE--
I LIKE IT PERSONAL.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:23.744
- ♪ HUSH, BABY FOREST WHITAKER
DON'T SAY A WORD ♪

00:02:23.777 --> 00:02:25.078
- GOO-GOO GA-GA.

00:02:25.112 --> 00:02:28.882
- ♪ MAMA'S GONNA
BUY YOU A MOCKINGBIRD ♪

00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:30.217
- GOOD BABYSITTER.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:33.820
- ♪ AND IF THAT MOCKINGBIRD
DON'T SING ♪

00:02:33.854 --> 00:02:35.756
- HAVE A GOOD CRY.

00:02:35.789 --> 00:02:37.891
- [sobbing]
♪ MAMA'S GONNA BUY YOU

00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:39.793
♪ A DIAMOND RING

